<title>USA: Eastern Enterprises Q4 net slips.</title>
<headline>Eastern Enterprises Q4 net slips.</headline>
<dateline>WESTON, Mass. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.84		    $0.93</p>
<p> Net			 17,160		   18,726</p>
<p> Revs		     240,652		  250,124</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,495		   20,329</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.97		    $2.66</p>
<p> Net			 60,665		   53,881</p>
<p> Revs		   1,007,342		  949,412</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,445		   20,285</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year includes gain of $0.12 a share from sale of investments.</p>
<p>1995 year includes gain of $1.02 a share from sale of investment in U.S. Filter Corp, offset by charges of $0.48 a share for environmental expenses and $0.32 a share for reserves under Coal Industry Retiree Health Benefit Act of 1992.</p>
<p>1996 results include equity losses from AllEnergy venture with the New England Electric System.</p>
